      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PIPE · Visual\n**Purpose**: one visual per package in every needed aspect (GN-3): the author's image (cropped, brand logo) or a generated image from the brief (first variant's brief; a separate brief call only if none) with the brand style; system rules: no people, text, logos. Generated images pass a vision check. Editor actions: regenerate, own upload (new variant versions, AP-3).\n**Input**: job {package_id, payload.mode: auto|regenerate|upload, payload.tg_file_id, payload.user_id, payload.wait}.\n**AI**: image.brief, image.generate, vision.check_image.",
